      "4.1 Use AI to create the first version, not the final version\nThe source demonstrates using Lovable to generate a website from a natural-language description. The initial page is produced quickly, but the creator then criticises it for unclear messaging, missing social proof, and imagery that does not connect with the intended customer.",
